# shadcn/ui — Always Use the Existing Component

The project has a full set of shadcn/ui components in `src/components/ui/`. Always use these instead of building raw HTML equivalents or reaching for Radix UI primitives directly.

| Need | Use |
|---|---|
| Clickable action | `<Button>` (with `variant` and `size` props) |
| Text input | `<Input>` |
| Multi-line input | `<Textarea>` |
| Dropdown/select | `<Select>`, `<SelectTrigger>`, `<SelectContent>`, `<SelectItem>` |
| Modal / confirmation | `<Dialog>`, `<DialogContent>`, `<DialogHeader>`, `<DialogFooter>` |
| Context menu / actions | `<DropdownMenu>` and its sub-components |
| Toggle | `<Switch>` |
| Checkbox | `<Checkbox>` |
| Field label | `<Label>` |
| Status tag | `<Badge>` |
| Content card | `<Card>`, `<CardHeader>`, `<CardContent>`, `<CardFooter>` |
| Data table | `<Table>`, `<TableHeader>`, `<TableBody>`, `<TableRow>`, `<TableCell>` |
| Empty resource state | `<EmptyState>` |
| Full-page loading | `<PageLoader>` |
| Inline loading rows | `<LoadingSkeleton>` |
| Inline API error | `<ErrorMessage error={error} onRetry={refetch}>` |

```jsx
// ❌ BAD — raw HTML when a shadcn component exists
<button className="px-4 py-2 bg-blue-500 text-white rounded">Save</button>
<input type="text" className="border rounded p-2" />

// ✅ GOOD
<Button variant="default">Save</Button>
<Input placeholder="Search..." />
```

